msgstr ""

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself in a wasteland surrounded by darkness and the ruins of an "
"ancient castle. Heavy breathing and ringing metal approach from afar. The "
"Skull Knight appears before you, a warrior in armor radiating dark power. "
"His magical attacks and mounted charge threaten your life. Prepare to battle"
" this legendary being with strength and ingenuity."
msgstr ""

