#. ~ New Horizon 3.0 development descriptions
#: modinfo.json
msgid "Berserk: New Horizon brings the world of Kentaro Miura's Berserk into the Cataclysm. Seek a Behelit, endure the Eclipse, and follow the trail of apostles through a changing world. Intended for a prepared mid-game survivor: bring armor, medical supplies and an escape plan before pursuing the story."
msgstr ""

#. ~ New Horizon 3.0 development descriptions
#: monsters/apostle_count.json
msgid "A human servant remade with the Count's flesh. A second jaw splits its chest, but beneath the deformity its body is still vulnerable. Shreds of a household uniform cling to its twisted limbs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ New Horizon 3.0 development descriptions
#: monsters/apostle_count.json
msgid "A gaunt prisoner hiding in the abandoned western wing. They watch the passages with exhausted eyes, listening for the guards. They may know a way through the residence, if you can earn a few words of trust."
msgstr ""

#. ~ New Horizon 3.0 development descriptions
#: monsters/flora_siege.json
msgid "A knot of living roots raised by Flora outside her sanctuary. Its branches brace against the earth as it bars the attackers' advance. The guardian leaves you and your companions unharmed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ New Horizon 3.0 development descriptions
#: monsters/flora_siege.json
msgid "Nosferatu Zodd forces his way through the northern roots of Flora's sanctuary. Every blow shakes the living barrier. This is the apostle himself, bearing down on the defenders with the weight of centuries of battle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ New Horizon 3.0 development descriptions
#: monsters/flora_siege.json
msgid "A towering armored apostle whose measured advance crushes the eastern ward. Grunbeld's heavy steps grind roots into the earth; his hammer can shatter the protection they offer. The spaces between his blows may be your chance to get clear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ New Horizon 3.0 development descriptions
#: items/flora_treehouse.json
msgid "Flora's handwritten advice for the road, with careful sketches of a waterskin and instructions for boiling cloth for dressings. Activate it to read and learn the recipes for boiled makeshift bandages and a waterskin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ New Horizon 3.0 development descriptions
#: items/flora_treehouse.json
msgid "Incomplete handwritten studies saved from the burning library. Smoke has darkened the margins, but Flora's patient handwriting survives between them. Activate it to read what could be saved."
msgstr ""

#. ~ New Horizon 3.0 development descriptions
#: items/flora_treehouse.json
msgid "A small wooden leaf from the roots of the lost house, its edges blackened by fire. It recalls a quiet room and the kindness offered there. Activate it to examine the keepsake and review the leads you already know."
msgstr ""

#: effects/first_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "The trail to the hollow is still unclear. Keep the notes: study them again or ask the Skull Knight after further exploration. No new hunt has been added to your missions."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "Heavy footsteps sound beyond the broken stone. Grunbeld has entered the crucible. Leave room to retreat and watch his hammer before committing to an attack."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "The remaining trails lead first to Flora. Consult her directions after closing the Count, Wyald and Rosine breaches; the road to Grunbeld continues beyond that meeting."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "Follow the Count, Wyald and Rosine trails and close their breaches. The surviving records will lead you to Flora. A grove you have already found remains known."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "Flora: Follow the Count, Black Dogs and misty valley trails. The records from their sealed breaches will reveal the road to the witch's grove."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "A sinewy knot that sharpens the senses of a stalking beast. While worn, it adds 2 tiles to your night-vision range."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "Remembered directions to a secluded forest manor. The records from the Count, Wyald and Rosine's sealed breaches reveal this road. Activate the directions to locate Flora or reveal the same manor again. They are memories, not a book, and can be used without knowing how to read."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "\"The rage lasts 150 seconds. The Beast Knot sharpens sight in darkness; it does not lengthen the armor's frenzy. When the rage ends, stamina is emptied, blood volume falls and a three-day recovery follows. Taking off the armor ends the rush, not its price. Prepare your retreat before losing control.\""
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "The records now lead to Flora, a witch who tends a protected spiritual tree. Follow her directions and seek counsel before the next great journey."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "\"The trails you have followed converge on a sheltered grove. Flora tends the old tree there. Ask her about the Brand and what it costs to wield cursed armor. I can leave you the directions so you need not depend on finding me again.\""
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "Follow the recovered trail to the ashen wound, then choose among the Count, the Black Dogs and the misty valley. Close their local breaches and keep the records you find; together they may show a road I cannot yet name for you."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "The first hunt is complete. Read the directions you recovered and inspect the marked ashen breach. The remaining records point toward the independent hunts."
msgstr ""

#: 3.1 geography, progression and relic updates
msgid "After leaving Flora's grove, follow the marked stronghold trail. Defeat both forms in the crucible, seal this site and claim its relic. If Grunbeld fell during the earlier battle, follow the surviving trace instead; his unique reward is not given twice."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.2: Godot and dialogue
msgid "Godot's woodland forge is marked on your map."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.2: Godot and dialogue
msgid "The old directions do not yet show the forge. Keep the notes and return to them after exploring farther."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.2: Godot and dialogue
msgid "Seek Godot and Rickert"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.2: Godot and dialogue
msgid "Visit the woodland forge. Godot can build an arm cannon, forge a Dragonslayer and repair your existing equipment. Rickert can explain the fitting."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.2: Godot and dialogue
msgid "Metal for an arm cannon"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.2: Godot and dialogue
msgid "Bring Godot 8 lumps of steel and 2 pipes. He accepts them together."
