#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb the Count’s flesh? You will slowly become a heavy, pliant apostle. Your movement will remain slower, throughout the transformation. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward. You cannot undo the choice by closing a breach."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Wyald’s flesh? You will slowly become a beastlike apostle. Your stamina will recover more slowly; your altered hands will hinder precise work. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Rosine’s flesh? You will slowly become a winged insectlike apostle. Your flesh will take more physical damage, throughout the transformation. Heavy equipment restricts your winged movements. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Grunbeld’s flesh? You will slowly grow an armored, fiery shape. Hunger and slow stamina recovery remain throughout the transformation; breathing fire overheats your body. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr ""

