#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your altered flesh slows you throughout the transformation. The Count shelters his own, but only while the pact holds. Your strength will never equal his."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your heavy body moves more slowly and needs more food, throughout the transformation. You serve Grunbeld; this lesser shell will never grow into his dragon."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your permanent pliant body grants +1 strength and 2 points of natural protection, with another -5 speed. Returning to human shape is impossible."
